 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Digital Advertising Digital Ad Services D3’s digital advertising services put your brand in front of the right people, in the right places, at the right time. We create ad strategies that maximize ROI and deliver measurable results through the platforms that work best for your industry. Paid digital ads are one of the fastest ways to build awareness and drive conversions. Factors like real-time targeting and performance tracking allow your campaigns to adapt as quickly as your audience’s behavior. This keeps your budget working to push your message further. D3’s Digital Ad Offerings Google Ads Capture demand, increase brand awareness, and compete with the top players in your industry through Google Ads campaigns. D3 experts build campaigns that focus on more than just clicks with high-intent keyword targeting, compelling ad copy, and tailored landing pages that drive real conversions. Our team continuously monitors the performance of your ad campaigns and makes data-driven adjustments to improve quality scores, lower cost-per-click, and maximize return on ad spend. Google Ads campaign types include search, display, shopping, videos, and performance max, which combines all platforms. Meta (Facebook & Instagram) Ads Engage customers where they spend their time. Meta ads are a budget-friendly way to promote your products and services to a wide audience of your choosing. Carousel and video ads are two popular choices for businesses to showcase all they have to offer. Geofencing Ads Target audiences by location with pinpoint accuracy. Geofencing draws a net around specific areas where your ad will serve. This can include competitor storefronts, event venues, or neighborhoods, making your campaigns more relevant and timely, and collecting high-quality user data. Programmatic Ads Programmatic ads can take your strategy to the next level. D3 helps to automate and optimize ad buying across the web, finding the right channels at the right costs. As always, our actions and real-time adjustments to the ads are supported by clear data analysis. Why Choose D3 for Digital Advertising? NO cookie-cutter campaigns. Every ad strategy is custom for your goals You will have full ownership of ad accounts and content No long-term commitments or contracts necessary Dedicated ads strategy team Work with D3 to create a digital advertising strategy that drives results across every channel. Case Studies Digital Marketing Services That Deliver CASTLE IN THE SAND HOTEL The Castle in the Sand Hotel has been an iconic Ocean City, MD destination for generations. Owned and operated by the Showell family, the hotel is known for its stunning oceanfront location, close to all the action, its variety of accommodations, and its family-friendly atmosphere. VIEW CASE STUDY OLD PRO GOLF Old Pro Golf has been delighting families in Ocean City, MD, since 1963. D3 helped bring their iconic courses into the modern era with a refreshed brand, vibrant photography, a dynamic new website, and playful social storytelling. From immersive course visuals to an online scorecard and streamlined event booking, every touchpoint celebrates nostalgia while engaging a new generation of mini-golfers. VIEW CASE STUDY PRIMO FAMILY RESTAURANT After a longstanding relationship with D3 for website hosting, Primo Family Restaurant partnered with our team to reimagine their digital presence and unify their marketing efforts into a cohesive, growth-focused strategy. Our goal was to create a digital experience that reflects the same quality, warmth, and authenticity guests enjoy in person. Through a comprehensive marketing initiative, including a new website and professional photography, social media and email marketing support, lead capture, and digital advertising, D3 brought Primo’s... VIEW CASE STUDY BOARDWALK HOTEL GROUP Building on a long-standing relationship, D3 led a comprehensive overhaul of Boardwalk Hotel Group’s four websites, refreshing photography and video, restructuring and streamlining extensive content, and updating design to better meet evolving guest expectations. The project showcased our project management strength and expertise while integrating seamlessly with ongoing marketing efforts to ensure cohesion across all initiatives. The result is a modern, unified website experience that maintains strong search performance, aligns with industry standards, and continues to drive... VIEW CASE STUDY DELAWARE ELEVATOR, INC. Delaware Elevator, Inc., a fourth-generation family owned and operated business, has roots as far back as the 1930’s in Wilmington, Delaware. The company was officially established and headquartered in Salisbury, Maryland in 1946 and has grown into one of the largest independent elevator corporations in the United States. Delaware Elevator has expanded its footprint from Wilmington, Delaware all the way down to the Florida Keys, offering a full range of services, including maintenance, repair, and installation of... VIEW CASE STUDY 1 2 3 4 5 Leverage D3’s Top Performing Digital Ad Services Submit the form below, or give us a call at 410-213-2400 First Name Last Name Company Name Phone Email How Did You Hear About D3? How Did You Hear About D3?* Google Search Social Media Word of Mouth Referral from a Friend or Colleague Event or Trade Show Walk-In / Drove By Print Advertisement Email Newsletter From Another Business Existing Client I'm Interested in the following Services: This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. SUBMIT Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design by D3, Ocean City MD Our Partners PREVIOUS Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google NEXT",
